Mar 31 02:16 02-application-engine.md\n-rw-------@  1 spy  staff   7708 Mar 31 02:16 03-vibespace-framework.md\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 19 spy  staff    608 May 27 23:35 agents\n-rwxr-xr-x@  1 spy  staff   7565 May 20 16:16 auto-commit.sh\ndrwx------  17 spy  staff    544 May 27 23:40 backend\n-rw-r--r--   1 spy  staff  17363 May 27 23:27 brief.md\n-rw-r--r--@  1 spy  staff  15832 May 27 23:33 CELLULAR-MAP.md\n-rw-r--r--@  1 spy  staff  11550 May 27 23:29 CLAUDE.md\ndrwxr-xr-x@  2 spy  staff     64 May 11 21:45 contracts\ndrwxr-xr-x@  6 spy  staff    192 May 20 16:16 deploy\n-rw-r--r--@  1 spy  staff  10539 May 11 18:26 digital-dash-pipeline.yml\n-rw-------   1 spy  staff   1283 Apr  3 22:19 docker-compose.yml\n-rw-r--r--@  1 spy  staff   2377 May 20 16:15 Dockerfile\ndrwx------  19 spy  staff    608 May 27 23:03 frontend\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 40 spy  staff   1280 May 27 23:34 hyphae\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 11 spy  staff    352 May 27 23:38 logs\n-rw-r--r--@  1 spy  staff   4872 May 20 16:16 Makefile\n-rw-r--r--@  1 spy  staff  30717 May 27 23:38 mycelium.yaml\n-rw-r--r--@  1 spy  staff  54351 May 27 23:31 NUTRIENTS.md\n-rw-------   1 spy  staff    121 Mar 31 21:53 pytest.ini\n-rw-------   1 spy  staff   7297 Mar 31 02:16 README.md\n-rw-r--r--@  1 spy  staff    663 May 27 22:58 requirements.txt\ndrwxr-xr-x@  6 spy  staff    192 May 27 23:10 sporenet\n-rwxr-xr-x@  1 spy  staff   9758 May 11 18:26 start.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x@  1 spy  staff    356 May 11 18:26 stop.sh\ndrwxr-xr-x@  6 spy  staff    192 May 27 23:42 synthetics\ndrwx------  10 spy  staff    320 May 27 23:03 tests\n-rw-r--r--@  1 spy  staff   2188 May 20 15:47 theme.yaml\ndrwx------   5 spy  staff    160 May 16 04:36 vibespace-framework","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}}
